        "Description": "Good day 47\rThis mission is a good one. The target is Orson Mills, who is responsible of an oil leak in the indian ocean, a huge PR scandal, as the local villages suffered sickness amongst it&apos;s people and wildlife. Our client originaly reached out to another agency, who stalked Orson in Mumbai, where he was hosting a press meeting surounding the scandal. A bodygurd named Perry Firmin caugth that agent and well..Orson has recently been located at a private estate in New Zeeland.\rHappy hunting  47",
